OL,3,A'Super-university' created amid funding
OL,4,Asqueeze
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe universities of Kent and Greenwich
OL,7,Fhave merged to form the UK's first
OL,8,F"super-university" amid sector-wide
OL,9,Ffinancial pressures.
OL,11,FThe new London and South East
OL,12,FUniversity Group (LASE) becomes the
OL,13,FUK's third largest, with more than
OL,14,F50,000 students across four campuses in
OL,15,Fsouth-east London and Kent.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
