OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'Super-university' created amid funding
OL,4,Asqueeze
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeaders say the institutions are "much
OL,7,Fstronger" together as higher education
OL,8,Fproviders face mounting economic
OL,9,Fstrain, but the University and College
OL,10,FUnion previously raised concerns that
OL,11,Fthe merger signalled a "broader problem
OL,12,Ffor the sector".
OL,14,FThe two universities, which legally
OL,15,Fmerged last month, will still operate
OL,16,Fas distinct academic divisions within
OL,17,Fthe group, retaining their current
OL,18,Fnames.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
